	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuae, reverende in Christo pater, mihi non <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>satis tempestive, attamen bona fide sunt redditae.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Nihil scripturus fueram, quod nihil haberem; <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>haec saltem scribo, ut intelligas tuas esse redditas, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sed et, si quid <persName>Solothurum</persName> scribere <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>velles, hic haberes certum hominem, qui illuc <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>proficiscitur et venit recta Venetiis, quo d. <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>de Bellieure eum miserat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="de">Es kommend der unseren <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ettlich uß der Etsch, under denen der banner<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>meister von <placeName>Ilantz</placeName>, zeigend an <persName>Hannibal <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>von Ems</persName> züche für uff <placeName>Genouw</placeName>; daa wüße <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>man nit anders, dan das Spanier zuͦ im <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>kommen und sy uff <placeName>Nissa</placeName> schiffen und mit <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>einanderen wider <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName> züchen sollind.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="de">Es <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>wil allethalben har schier glych luten.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Die <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>uß <placeName>Tütschland</placeName> in die Etsch und zuͦ uns <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>kommend, zeigend an, man mache ein nüw <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>volck in steyeren und Schwaaben.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hoc an ita <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sit, non affirmo, scribo tamen, ut, si aliunde <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quoque nuncientur, tu conferre queas.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Pro <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>cęteris rebus novis gratias ago immortales.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Sed quae ex <placeName>Gallia</placeName> nunciantur, me terrent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Sed auxilium nostrum a domino, qui fecit <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>coelum et terram.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Hoc certum est, quod non <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>de nostro modo vulnere, sed etiam hostili sanguis <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>fluet quodque sperandum sit belli calamitatem <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tandem in ipsos recubituram, qui a nostris <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>caedis faciunt initium.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed peccata nostra me <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>terrent et rerum omnium <foreign xml:lang="el">ἀταξία</foreign>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Dominus <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ergo rogandus, ne in furore suo nos redarguat.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende in Christo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>pater, cum tuis omnibus quam felicissime et diutissime.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 10. iulii anno 1<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>564. festinantissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p8009">Fabricius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, domino su<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>o et in Christo patri reverendo.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>